program:
  p = &x
  q = &y
  r = p
  r = q
  s = &r
  t = *s
  u = &z
  *s = u
Andersen (subsets):
  p -> {x}
  q -> {y}
  r -> {x, y, z}
  s -> {r}
  t -> {x, y, z}
  u -> {z}
  *p and *q may alias: no
Steensgaard (unification):
  p -> {x, y, z}
  q -> {x, y, z}
  r -> {x, y, z}
  s -> {r}
  t -> {x, y, z}
  u -> {x, y, z}
  *p and *q may alias: yes
